    "confidence": 0.94,
    "explanation": "The SGD 4.00 cancellation fee stands, and the driver is paid SGD 3.20, which is 80 percent of the SGD 4.00 fee under POL-NS-07. Both figures are read from the fare breakdown EV-FARE-02704: cancellation_fee 4.00, total_charged 4.00, payment_status CHARGED, refund_issued_sgd 0.00, and its derived driver_compensation figure of 3.20. On a DRIVER_COMPENSATION ruling the amount_sgd field carries that same SGD 3.20, as POL-GEN-03 requires.\n\nAll four conditions of POL-NS-01 hold on the driver's own telemetry. (a) The trip record EV-TRIP-02704 carries the driver's arrival event at 21:58:18. (b) The GPS trace EV-GPS-02704 places the driver 0.11 m from the pickup pin at that same second, far inside the 50 m STANDARD arrival radius. (c) He then held position continuously for 454 seconds, from 21:58:18 to 22:05:52, against the 300 second free waiting period carried in trip_record.platform_policy.free_wait_sec - a surplus of 154 seconds, not a shortfall. (d) The record shows no boarding event and a termination by the driver at 22:05:55 under the reason code RIDER_NO_SHOW, which is one of the three codes the limb recognises, after the required dwell had elapsed. POL-NS-05 does not fire: at the arrival timestamp the driver was at the pin and stationary (dwell-start offset 0.0 s), so the marker is not false and no waiting clock needs recomputing. POL-NS-06 gives the rider nothing: there is no shortfall, and limb (i) is in any event unavailable - the advisory EV-ADVIS-02704-01 is MISSING with weight_multiplier 0.0 and issue code MISSING_ARTIFACT, so it can carry no fact and nothing in this ruling rests on it; the dwell is a single continuous run of 454 seconds, so no accumulation across intervals is needed. POL-NS-03 is not engaged: the driver's stationary fixes lie inside the arrival radius, not outside it, and the trip has one registered pickup point. POL-NS-10 gives nothing: the rider did not cancel, the trip was not scheduled, and the waiting-time line is SGD 0.00.\n\nThe rider's arguments are answered. POL-NS-04 does not exonerate the rider: limb (a) requires a message sent by the rider during the waiting window, and the chat log EV-CHAT-02704 holds a single message sent by the driver at 21:58:48 and read at 21:59:38, with no rider reply. The rider's account that the driver cancelled 'while I was walking to the bay' is contradicted by the rider's own device: all 72 rider fixes report 0.0 km/h and sit between 606 m and 613 m from the pickup pin, with zero qualifying fixes inside the 100 m rider-presence radius. The submission that POL-NS-01 limb (d) fails because the driver 'had not located' the rider is rejected. Limb (d) reads the reason code recorded on the trip record, and that code is RIDER_NO_SHOW - one of the three the limb recognises. DRIVER_UNABLE_TO_LOCATE, the code that would not satisfy the limb, is not on this record. The driver's one message asking which door the rider was at is a coordination attempt made during a full 454 second wait, not a recorded admission, and it went unanswered. The driver-education referral the rider asks for attaches only to a cancellation recorded under a code other than the rider's failure to appear; no such code was used here.\n\nOn the driver's side, the POL-NS-07 anti-farming check does not trip: driver_profile.no_show_terminations_30d is 2, below the threshold of 4, and 2 divided by 111 completed trips in 30 days is 0.018, below 0.08. Those are the only two profile fields POL-NS-07 permits for that check. No POL-NS-09 trigger is present: confidence is above the 0.70 floor, no admissible artifacts contradict each other on arrival, dwell or rider presence, the counterparty-dispute counters are 0 on both profiles, and the anti-farming check is clear. No escalation, and no clause produces a referral, so the referrals list is empty.\n\nConfidence is 0.94. The deciding facts - the driver's position at the pin, his 454 second dwell, and the manner of termination - are carried by the GPS trace EV-GPS-02704 and the trip record EV-TRIP-02704, both at weight_multiplier 1.0, so the POL-GEN-02(2) cap is 1.0. The only artifact below full weight in the bundle is the MISSING advisory, which carries no deciding fact and does not lower the cap. The monetary effect, SGD 3.20, is below the SGD 8.00 execution threshold, so it executes automatically, subject to the appeal route."
  },
  "discarded_claims": []
}
